{
  "Super Sudokoid: Dark Inversion": "超级数独机器人 2：暗影反转",
  "Super Sudokoid: Dark Inversion by The M": "超级数独机器人 2：暗影反转（The M 制作）",
  "Dark Inversion": "暗影反转",
  "Super Sudokoid": "超级数独机器人",
  "The M": "The M",
  "It's done! Every corner of the planet has been explored, every secret found.\n\nCONGRATULATIONS! You've managed to solve the puzzle to its entirety, you even found the hidden puzzle! \n\nThanks for playing!": "终于完成了！星球的每个角落都已探索，每个秘密都已发现。\n\n恭喜！你不仅完整解开了这个谜题，甚至找到了隐藏谜题！\n\n感谢游玩！",
  "While cruising through hyperspace, as one does on occasion, your radio suddenly picks up a distress signal from a nearby solar system. The planet it originates from isn't on your star chart, but your ship's computer is adamant that this is none other than the lost home world of the ancient Puzzlo race, known for their penchant for intricate puzzle, and deadly super-weapons. With trepidation, you set course to land.\n\n---\n\nWhen playing this in SudokuPad, consider turning ON the following settings for a better experience:\n* Outlines On Digits\n* Draw Arrows Above Lines\n* Disable Emoji Replacement (this one is a little spotty in some browsers -- turn it off if you don't see a boss cell in the starting sector)\n* Test Large Puzzle UI (which allows you to zoom with the scroll wheel and pan by right-clicking and dragging the mouse).\n* Check On Finish  <-- This one is required!\n\nThis puzzle is not mobile friendly!\n\n---\n\nThis is a dynamic, expanding puzzle. More cells, rules and story segments will be revealed as you play.\n\nSECTORS: the grid consists of 16 sectors. Each sector is a separate 9x9 Sudoku puzzle. Normal Sudoku rules apply separately within each sector, but other rules may span multiple sectors.\n\nWALLS: purple cells separated with a border are wall cells. They do not count as part of the grid and Sudoku rules DO NOT apply to them (meaning that some rows, columns and boxes will have fewer than nine digits in them). Do note that if any other clue applies to a wall cell, the cell still needs to contain a digit that satisfies that clue.\n\nHUD: the area to the right is your HUD. It will be updated with new information as you progress through the puzzle. Click on any revealed HUD cell to update this description with information on that particular story entry, rule description or boss link.\n\nBOSSES: there are a few bosses scattered throughout the map. Once you've managed to place a digit in a boss cell the HUD will be updated. Click on that cell to get a link to a separate boss puzzle. Solve it to defeat the boss and progress in the main puzzle by placing the rewarded digit in the boss's HUD cell.\n\nUPGRADES: yellow circles indicate points of interest. If you fill in a circled cell, check the HUD for story updates and new rules.\n\nCOSMETIC CELLS: pink cells are identical to their neighbors, the color variation is purely cosmetic.\n\nHINTS: if you get stuck and need help figuring out what to do next, click in the top-right corner to access a secret list of vague objectives for each story moment.": "你正像往常一样穿越超空间，通讯器突然接收到附近恒星系发来的求救信号。发信星球不在星图上，飞船电脑却坚称那是古老谜族（Puzzlo）失落的故乡。这个种族以复杂精妙的谜题和致命超级武器闻名。你带着忐忑的心情，决定降落调查。\n\n---\n\n在 SudokuPad 中游玩时，建议开启以下设置以获得更好体验：\n* 数字描边\n* 箭头显示在线条上方\n* 禁用表情符号替换（部分浏览器可能有显示问题；如果起始区域看不到首领格，请关闭此功能）\n* 大型谜题界面测试（支持鼠标滚轮缩放及按住鼠标右键拖动地图）\n* 完成时检查（此项为必需！）\n\n本谜题最初并非针对手机设计！\n\n---\n\n这是一个会随着游玩不断扩展的动态谜题。新的格子、规则和剧情会陆续揭晓。\n\n**区域（SECTORS）**：棋盘分为 16 个区域，每个区域都是独立的 9×9 数独。标准数独规则分别适用于各区域，但某些其他规则可能跨越多个区域。\n\n**墙壁（WALLS）**：以边框隔开的紫色格子是墙壁格，不属于标准数独棋盘，不受数独规则约束（因此某些行、列或宫可能少于九个数字）。不过，如果有其他线索涉及墙壁格，仍须填写满足该线索的数字。\n\n**状态面板（HUD）**：棋盘右侧为状态面板。随着解谜进展，面板会显示新信息。点击已经揭示的面板格，可在这里查看对应剧情、规则说明或首领链接。\n\n**首领（BOSSES）**：地图各处散布着数位首领。当你成功填入一个首领格的数字，状态面板便会更新。点击相应面板格取得独立首领谜题的链接。解开首领谜题后，将奖励的数字填入首领在状态面板中的格子，才能继续推进主线。\n\n**升级（UPGRADES）**：黄色圆圈表示值得调查的地点。填入圈内格子的数字后，检查状态面板，获取剧情更新和新规则。\n\n**装饰格（COSMETIC CELLS）**：粉色格与周围格子没有规则上的差异，颜色只是装饰。\n\n**提示（HINTS）**：如果卡住，不知道接下来该做什么，可点击右上角查看按剧情顺序排列的隐秘目标提示清单。",
  "[Click here to go to the boss puzzle](https://sudokupad.app/1hh6q5xl6l)": "[点击进入首领谜题](https://sudokupad.app/1hh6q5xl6l)",
  "[Click here to go to the boss puzzle](https://sudokupad.app/64c4lkb5ss)": "[点击进入首领谜题](https://sudokupad.app/64c4lkb5ss)",
